# Perf route for Fortune's Weave: boot -> Continue -> save slot 000 -> the saved battle map, then two measured scenes.
# Runs unattended with [test] script = <this file> (tools/perf/ab_run.ps1 sets it); the run ends itself at @pass.
# docs/PERF_ROUTES.md: what each step is for and how to adapt the menu presses to your save.
#
# Waits are host time (@sleep), not frames: the same route then covers the same game time at any frame rate, and a slower load
# only eats into the margin. A @shot after each menu step shows in <[test] shot_dir> whether the press landed where it should.

@timeout 0

# --- the front end ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@sleep 15000
@shot 01_title
press A
@sleep 4000
@shot 02_menu
# Continue (the first entry of the title menu)
press A
@sleep 3000
@shot 03_slots
# save slot 000, then confirm the load
press A
@sleep 3000
press A

# --- into the map: let the load, the texture streaming and the background shader work settle ----------------------------
@sleep 30000
@shot 04_map

# --- scene 1: the map standing still (render thread and GPU cost of the scene itself) -----------------------------------
@log SCENE start map_still
@sleep 20000
@log SCENE end map_still

# --- scene 2: the cursor panning the camera around (camera turns, streaming, culling) -----------------------------------
@log SCENE start map_pan
stick left 1 0
@sleep 2500
stick left 0 1
@sleep 2500
stick left -1 0
@sleep 2500
stick left 0 -1
@sleep 2500
stick left 0 0
@sleep 1000
@log SCENE end map_pan

@shot 05_end
@pass
